# M5b's top bar at the widths where it changes (TopBar.module.css, ThemeChip.module.css), each
# shot at rest after a resize. The bar's parts keep their own widths and the title block gives
# way: at 700 px it has 261.58 of the subtitle's 275, so the subtitle ends in an ellipsis with the
# chip still there; at 641 the chip still shows (202.58 px left); at 640 (max-width: 640px) the
# chip is gone and the block has room again (329.08); at 521 the wordmark keeps its name and the
# subtitle is cut again (210.08); at 520 (max-width: 520px) only the mark is left (317); at 420,
# the native window's narrowest (plan call 6), it is cut again (217). All of them stack (under
# 900) and at 420 the rows drop their names (under 470).
size 700 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot topbar-700
size 641 900
wait 32
shot topbar-641
size 640 900
wait 32
shot topbar-640
size 521 900
wait 32
shot topbar-521
size 520 900
wait 32
shot topbar-520
size 420 900
wait 32
shot topbar-420
